## 3) MapType Practical

### 3.1 Create MapType column

```python
data2 = [
    (1, {"city": "Pune", "state": "MH"}),
    (2, {"city": "Mumbai", "state": "MH"}),
    (3, None)
]

schema2 = StructType([
    StructField("id", IntegerType(), True),
    StructField("address", MapType(StringType(), StringType()), True)
])

df_map = spark.createDataFrame(data2, schema2)
df_map.show(truncate=False)
df_map.printSchema()
```

---

### 3.2 getItem() for Map

```python
df_map.select(
    col("id"),
    col("address").getItem("city").alias("city"),
    col("address").getItem("state").alias("state")
).show(truncate=False)
```

