## 4) StructType Nested Practical

### 4.1 Create nested struct

```python
data3 = [
    (1, ("Pramod", 24)),
    (2, ("Akash", 25)),
    (3, ("Rahul", None))
]

schema3 = StructType([
    StructField("id", IntegerType(), True),
    StructField("person", StructType([
        StructField("name", StringType(), True),
        StructField("age", IntegerType(), True)
    ]), True)
])

df_struct = spark.createDataFrame(data3, schema3)
df_struct.show(truncate=False)
df_struct.printSchema()
```

---

### 4.2 Access struct fields

```python
df_struct.select(
    col("id"),
    col("person.name").alias("name"),
    col("person.age").alias("age")
).show(truncate=False)
```

